## Reference Materials

### PDF Content Summary

Source notes about chlorophyll.

### Available Images

- **img_2**: image from biology.pdf page 2 | size: 800×600 (aspect ratio 1.33) [see attached]

### Web Search Results

A current source summary.

Teacher Persona:
Use a Socratic style.

